                <pb facs="0223" n="127" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg127"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-05-21"><hi rendition="#italic">May 21,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Boxers greatly increased in this province in and around Pekin. Village 40 miles
                    Pekin burned. Sixty native Catholics killed. No foreigners attacked. Chinese
                    Government aroused and promises immediate suppression. Diplomatic corps demanded
                    immediate effective measures. <hi rendition="#italic">Newark</hi> en route Taku.
                    I hope and believe the worst has passed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
